        <h2>Let Your Agents Focus</h2>
        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Complete the SDLC with focused review and document agents, typed proof, bounded patch loops, and conditional memory that feeds the next plan.</p>
        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Tactic #6 · One Agent, One Prompt, One Purpose</li><li>90–120 min lab</li><li>12 course frames</li><li>2 current-practice overlays</li></ul>
        <a class="button" href="vol-1-tac/06-let-your-agents-focus.html">Start chapter →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="chapter-feature__map" aria-label="One agent, one prompt, one purpose visual">
        <div class="focus-three"><div>One agent</div><div>One prompt</div><div>One purpose</div></div>
      </div>
    </article>

